### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testing124"
}

### Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}